<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kent raised near-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kent raised near-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch raised its rating of Kent Electronics Corp to a near-term accumulate from a near-term neutral on Tuesday. It maintained its long-term buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Monday at 26-3/4.</p>
</text>
